# Visual Studio machine-specific workspace config
.vsconfig
# The sample project is only a host for the plugin and needs no project config.
# The editor regenerates Config/ on launch and writes machine-specific values
# into it (e.g. a random AndroidFileServer SecurityToken), so keep it out of git.
